 "lines": [
  {
   "line": "1",
   "scene": 1,
   "text": "What if the best way to save tokens",
   "clip": "audio/read2/01-01.wav",
   "at": 0.52,
   "start": 0.7,
   "end": 2.98,
   "src": "clips/read2-01-01-d92b6fd3a23c.mp3",
   "adr": 0,
   "unread": false,
   "lead": 0.18
  },
  {
   "line": "2",
   "scene": 1,
   "text": "Is to stop writing bad code?",
   "clip": "audio/read2/01-02.wav",
   "at": 2.98,
   "start": 2.98,
   "end": 5.58,
   "src": "clips/read2-01-02-66dbff8e4dd8.mp3",
   "adr": 0,
   "unread": false,
   "lead": 0.0
  },
  {
   "line": "3",
   "scene": 2,
   "text": "Our industry is lost in a fog.",
   "clip": "audio/read2/02-03.wav",
   "at": 6.84,
   "start": 7.02,
   "end": 9.04,
   "src": "clips/read2-02-03-1307f241a6d3.mp3",
   "adr": 0,
   "unread": false,
   "lead": 0.18
  },
  {
   "line": "4",
   "scene": 2,
   "text": "We have completely new tools for building software, and we can build it faster than ever.",
   "clip": "audio/read2/02-04.wav",
   "at": 9.56,
   "start": 9.74,
   "end": 14.24,
   "src": "clips/read2-02-04-20a5c6390202.mp3",
   "adr": 0,
   "unread": false,
   "lead": 0.18
  },
  {
   "line": "5",
   "scene": 2,
   "text": "But our processes have never been more confused. The work we do is more opaque, more complex, more difficult to reason about than at any point in our careers.",
   "clip": "audio/read2/02-05.wav",
   "at": 14.34,
   "start": 14.52,
   "end": 24.72,
   "src": "clips/read2-02-05-e8766ddb2af1.mp3",
   "adr": 0,
   "unread": false,
   "lead": 0.18
  },
  {
   "line": "6",
   "scene": 3,
   "text": "We can imagine new code, we can describe thoughtful architecture, we can specify sturdy systems.",
   "clip": "audio/read2/03-06.wav",
   "at": 25.22,
   "start": 25.4,
   "end": 30.98,
   "src": "clips/read2-03-06-0de5d352edad.mp3",
   "adr": 0,
   "unread": false,
   "lead": 0.18
  },
  {
   "line": "7",
   "scene": 3,
   "text": "But we have no idea how faithfully our robots are building for us. The more complex our designs, the more challenging they are to validate.",
   "clip": "audio/read2/03-07.wav",
   "at": 31.38,
   "start": 31.56,
   "end": 38.6,
   "src": "clips/read2-03-07-f892f83e6e55.mp3",
   "adr": 0,
   "unread": false,
   "lead": 0.18
  },
  {
   "line": "8",
   "scene": 3,
   "text": "Agents are writing good code by accident.",
   "clip": "audio/read2/03-08.wav",
   "at": 39.22,
   "start": 39.4,
   "end": 42.2,
   "src": "clips/read2-03-08-0515a67fed0e.mp3",
   "adr": 0,
   "unread": false,
   "lead": 0.18
  },
  {
   "line": "9",
   "scene": 4,
   "text": "The systems at our disposal are trained to finish the job at any cost, so they cut subtle corners where we can\u2019t see.",
   "clip": "audio/read2/04-09.wav",
   "at": 43.42,
   "start": 43.6,
   "end": 50.34,
   "src": "clips/read2-04-09-bfa5dbcf7fd9.mp3",
   "adr": 0,
   "unread": false,
   "lead": 0.18
  },
  {
   "line": "10",
   "scene": 4,
   "text": "Understanding it all requires reading code and reasoning about its consequences, but every day there\u2019s just more.",
   "clip": "audio/read2/04-10.wav",
   "at": 51.67,
   "start": 51.85,
   "end": 57.15,
   "src": "clips/read2-04-10-193f60028b85.mp3",
   "adr": 0,
   "unread": false,
   "lead": 0.18
  },
  {
   "line": "11",
   "scene": 4,
   "text": "More complexity than we can possibly get our arms around.",
   "clip": "audio/read2/04-11.wav",
   "at": 57.81,
   "start": 57.95,
   "end": 61.07,
   "src": "clips/read2-04-11-903b81f0eef1.mp3",
   "adr": 0,
   "unread": false,
   "lead": 0.14
  },
  {
   "line": "12",
   "scene": 5,
   "text": "Our solution? Throw more inference at the problem. We use inference to write code, then we use more inference to ask if the code we wrote was good.",
   "clip": "audio/read2/05-12.wav",
   "at": 61.87,
   "start": 62.05,
   "end": 69.59,
   "src": "clips/read2-05-12-7284b6a2935b.mp3",
   "adr": 0,
   "unread": false,
   "lead": 0.18
  },
  {
   "line": "13",
   "scene": 5,
   "text": "So what do we get for all this? Bugs that recur. Endless whack a mole adversarial reviews.",
   "clip": "audio/read2/05-13.wav",
   "at": 70.92,
   "start": 71.1,
   "end": 76.76,
   "src": "clips/read2-05-13-c686ee581145.mp3",
   "adr": 0,
   "unread": false,
   "lead": 0.18
  },
  {
   "line": "14",
   "scene": 6,
   "text": "OpenRouter does twenty trillion tokens a day. GitHub struggles to stay online.",
   "clip": "audio/read2/06-14.wav",
   "at": 77.52,
   "start": 77.7,
   "end": 82.98,
   "src": "clips/read2-06-14-3e5242b4371a.mp3",
   "adr": 0,
   "unread": false,
   "lead": 0.18
  },
  {
   "line": "15",
   "scene": 6,
   "text": "Software staggers under this scale of motion.",
   "clip": "audio/read2/06-15.wav",
   "at": 83.53,
   "start": 83.7,
   "end": 86.26,
   "src": "clips/read2-06-15-1d89a57b96a6.mp3",
   "adr": 0,
   "unread": false,
   "lead": 0.17
  },
  {
   "line": "16",
   "scene": 6,
   "text": "Because we don\u2019t yet have the tools to make sense of this new world.",
   "clip": "audio/read2/06-16.wav",
   "at": 87.22,
   "start": 87.4,
   "end": 91.32,
   "src": "clips/read2-06-16-06c315dc153d.mp3",
   "adr": 0,
   "unread": false,
   "lead": 0.18
  },
  {
   "line": "17",
   "scene": 7,
   "text": "It's time to build the next generation of tools.",
   "clip": "audio/read2/07-17.wav",
   "at": 94.12,
   "start": 94.3,
   "end": 97.42,
   "src": "clips/read2-07-17-319af7f6e1b5.mp3",
   "adr": 0,
   "unread": false,
   "lead": 0.18
  },
  {
   "line": "18",
   "scene": 7,
   "text": "Developers need clarity and confidence, not just speed.",
   "clip": "audio/read1/07-18.wav",
   "at": 98.37,
   "start": 98.55,
   "end": 101.93,
   "src": "clips/read1-07-18-8a188d8d01cb.mp3",
   "adr": 0,
   "unread": false,
   "lead": 0.18
  },
  {
   "line": "19",
   "scene": 7,
   "text": "The race is on to deliver. Coherence lets us compete.",
   "clip": "audio/adr/20260924-230300-take-jc00z2u0/19.wav",
   "at": 102.085,
   "start": 102.265,
   "end": 106.025,
   "src": "clips/20260924-230300-take-jc00z2u0-19-a8dbdccd98f4.mp3",
   "adr": 1,
   "unread": false,
   "lead": 0.18
  },
  {
   "line": "20",
   "scene": 8,
   "text": "We start with clear definitions.",
   "clip": "audio/adr/20260924-220607-take-7a7d-yq9/20.wav",
   "at": 107.319,
   "start": 107.499,
   "end": 109.739,
   "src": "clips/20260924-220607-take-7a7d-yq9-20-485c8ef0743a.mp3",
   "adr": 2,
   "unread": false,
   "lead": 0.18
  },
  {
   "line": "21",
   "scene": 8,
   "text": "Language models are built out of language. Clearly defining your terms changes their behavior. Agents start to do what you meant, not just what you said.",
   "clip": "audio/adr/20260924-220607-take-7a7d-yq9/21.wav",
   "at": 110.319,
   "start": 110.499,
   "end": 119.979,
   "src": "clips/20260924-220607-take-7a7d-yq9-21-a4c2327ae21c.mp3",
   "adr": 2,
   "unread": false,
   "lead": 0.18
  },
  {
   "line": "22",
   "scene": 8,
   "text": "This impacts the integrity of what gets built, making bugs easier for agents to detect.",
   "clip": "audio/adr/20260924-220607-take-7a7d-yq9/22.wav",
   "at": 120.559,
   "start": 120.739,
   "end": 125.639,
   "src": "clips/20260924-220607-take-7a7d-yq9-22-b710908191d0.mp3",
   "adr": 1,
   "unread": false,
   "lead": 0.18
  },
  {
   "line": "23",
   "scene": 9,
   "text": "But we can do more.",
   "clip": "audio/read1/09-23.wav",
   "at": 126.152,
   "start": 126.332,
   "end": 127.552,
   "src": "clips/read1-09-23-603de3a5f30f.mp3",
   "adr": 0,
   "unread": false,
   "lead": 0.18
  },
  {
   "line": "24",
   "scene": 9,
   "text": "The Coherence decision journal compresses hundreds of thousands of tokens into a handful of decisions.",
   "clip": "audio/read1/09-24.wav",
   "at": 127.892,
   "start": 128.072,
   "end": 133.392,
   "src": "clips/read1-09-24-3093a3944014.mp3",
   "adr": 0,
   "unread": false,
   "lead": 0.18
  },
  {
   "line": "25",
   "scene": 9,
   "text": "If a bad call happened in the process, it\u2019s right there in the history, instead of buried in code.",
   "clip": "audio/read1/09-25.wav",
   "at": 133.632,
   "start": 133.812,
   "end": 138.732,
